OL,3,GNEWSANew community sports pavilion
OL,4,Aconstruction finished
OL,5,
OL,6,FKeys to a new community sports and
OL,7,Fwellbeing pavilion have been formally
OL,8,Fhanded to a after builders finished its
OL,9,Fconstruction.
OL,11,FThe project which started in August
OL,12,F2025 was led by Truro City Council and
OL,13,Fforms part of a wider #5.2 million
OL,14,Finitiative to improve the facilities at
OL,15,FBoscawen Park.
OL,17,FWork has now started fitting out the
OL,18,Finterior of the pavilion so it is ready
OL,19,Ffor use by the local community.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
